// with rounds IN THE MIDDLE of the jump's window (for the fifth case below).


// Discord "Canceling a contract doesn't affect the race schedule": breaking a contract did not remove the clash
// in the calendar that the contract caused. BreakContract deleted the contract from save.contracts but left its
// enrollment in cc.enrollments, and everything the calendar knows about "your rounds" comes from there: the ⚠ in the
// calendar (BuildMasterCalendar -> conflict), the market's season clash (SeasonClashesFor), the
// absences the jump shows (JumpPreview, the SAME DnfPassedRounds as the real penalty). The test enters through
