// FINAL contract: SaveData gains an additive `emails` vector (GeneratedEmail: id|tag|day|family|read|answered|
// choice|subtype|payload-key — pipe-delimited, space-bearing payload-key survives, the resolved EN/ES BODY is
// NEVER persisted, bilingual-by-TR) and an additive `career_seed` scalar; a legacy file with no email lines
// loads to empty + seed 0; both ride kSaveVersion=2 (no re-bump), MigrateSave no-op.
