// like Josh's on 31/08: full live catalog and Steam saying no to everything. Loads PRODUCTION data
// (series, calendar, circuits): goes at the end of the suite.


// The market doesn't offer unplayable series (a class with no installed cars), and
// promotions from the feeder ranks never point to an unplayable series.


