// legitimate floor, career_save.cpp:1155-1156); from that point on, load+save produce the same result. The
// saves go to build/ -- NEVER to tools/fixtures/, because SaveCareer deletes the destination before
// renaming (career_save.cpp:16-19), and a path mistake here would destroy the committed artifact.


